{"3962130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Regrown", "steam_appid": 3962130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the art of botany</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a master botanist by learning what each plant needs to thrive. You'll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage water</strong> to achieve &quot;perfect&quot; growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control light exposure</strong> to prevent leaf burns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check soil conditions</strong> to ensure plants get enough nutrients.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/3a89f925070e1e68b47e8cea0a64e45a.poster.avif?t=1770768732\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/3a89f925070e1e68b47e8cea0a64e45a.webm?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/3a89f925070e1e68b47e8cea0a64e45a.mp4?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Thriving Plant Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful business is about more than just growing plants. You'll need to master the art of management by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocking new plant varieties</strong>, from cascading hanging plants to resilient cacti, to expand your offerings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting your own prices</strong> based on customer desires and market trends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing your shop's reputation</strong> to attract new customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizing your shop</strong> to create a space that's uniquely yours.<br>Expand your plant repertoire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/b1265cd6b9f8ee2a30c4a11dc713174e.poster.avif?t=1770768732\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/b1265cd6b9f8ee2a30c4a11dc713174e.webm?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/b1265cd6b9f8ee2a30c4a11dc713174e.mp4?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find rare plant mutations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you grow a plant, there is a chance that the plant will have a rare mutations, each mutated plant can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >increase your shop reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >allow you to sell your plants for more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >contribute to a better growth for your other plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the art of botany</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a master botanist by learning what each plant needs to thrive. You'll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage water</strong> to achieve &quot;perfect&quot; growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control light exposure</strong> to prevent leaf burns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check soil conditions</strong> to ensure plants get enough nutrients.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/3a89f925070e1e68b47e8cea0a64e45a.poster.avif?t=1770768732\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/3a89f925070e1e68b47e8cea0a64e45a.webm?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/3a89f925070e1e68b47e8cea0a64e45a.mp4?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Thriving Plant Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful business is about more than just growing plants. You'll need to master the art of management by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocking new plant varieties</strong>, from cascading hanging plants to resilient cacti, to expand your offerings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting your own prices</strong> based on customer desires and market trends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing your shop's reputation</strong> to attract new customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizing your shop</strong> to create a space that's uniquely yours.<br>Expand your plant repertoire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/b1265cd6b9f8ee2a30c4a11dc713174e.poster.avif?t=1770768732\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/b1265cd6b9f8ee2a30c4a11dc713174e.webm?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/extras/b1265cd6b9f8ee2a30c4a11dc713174e.mp4?t=1770768732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find rare plant mutations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you grow a plant, there is a chance that the plant will have a rare mutations, each mutated plant can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >increase your shop reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >allow you to sell your plants for more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >contribute to a better growth for your other plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Regrown is a cozy management game where you will need to plant, grow and sell your plants to increase your shop's reputation and repertoire. Use the money you've earned to unlock new rare species and customize your shop to your liking. Get your shop to be the most popular in town.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/ef16b3a4a98e36eb92f19ed3492e5180138cf430/header.jpg?t=1770768732", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/f55c4811096a74264c3ad5ec8728a50c84036284/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770768732", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962130/f55c4811096a74264c3ad5ec8728a50c84036284/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770768732", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (6